  "contentHtml": "<p>연구수업을 준비하며&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>재과만의 진영 선생님 자료와&#160;like green 을 참고로 하여 진행하였습니다.&#160;</p><p>교사 설명 후 패들렛에 아이들의 선언을 작성하고&#160;</p><p>그 후 5~10분 정도 자신들의 선언을 친구들 앞에서 직접 읽어보는 시간을 가졌습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>선생님들께 도움이 될까 싶어 ppt 자료 올립니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>용량이 커서 링크로 올립니다.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>(진영선생님처럼 드라이브로 공유해드리고 싶은데, 제가 방법을 몰라서..</p><p>혹시 방법을 알려주시면 드라이브 파일로 올리겠습니다. )</p><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1M2JOYT5SLMDSPVhED8Clp_pdY5vL7JGt/edit?usp=sharing&amp;ouid=102664805598016134572&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1M2JOYT5SLMDSPVhED8Clp_pdY5vL7JGt/edit?usp=sharing&amp;ouid=102664805598016134572&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true</a>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"기후위기 - 배포용.pptx\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"docs.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1M2JOYT5SLMDSPVhED8Clp_pdY5vL7JGt/edit?usp=sharing&amp;ouid=102664805598016134572&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true\" data-og-url=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1M2JOYT5SLMDSPVhED8Clp_pdY5vL7JGt/edit?usp=sharing&amp;ouid=102664805598016134572&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true&amp;usp=embed_facebook\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1M2JOYT5SLMDSPVhED8Clp_pdY5vL7JGt/edit?usp=sharing&amp;ouid=102664805598016134572&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1M2JOYT5SLMDSPVhED8Clp_pdY5vL7JGt/edit?usp=sharing&amp;ouid=102664805598016134572&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true\"><div class=\"og-image\" style=\"background-image:url(null)\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">기후위기 - 배포용.pptx</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">docs.google.com</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
